## Before you write: converge

You'll pick your leading idea **in the <course-link type="page" id="s06">{{ S06_DAY }}, {{ S06_DATE }} convergence workshop</course-link>** — scoring your candidates against the selection criteria and getting peer + instructor feedback. **Don't write this brief before then** — it documents the *one* idea you converge on, and until the workshop you still have several candidates in play. Bring your **2–3 candidates + Discovery Notes** to Wednesday; leave with a chosen idea and feedback on it; then write the brief over the next few days. It's due the following **{{ S07_DAY }}, {{ S07_DATE }}**, so you have the weekend to do it justice.

